scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["commission acts as addressee in action 1", "commission acts as addressee in action 11", "competent authority acts as addresser in action 5", "designated authority acts as addressee in action 2", "designated authority acts as addressee in action 8", "designated authority acts as addresser in action 10", "designated authority acts as addresser in action 3", "designated authority acts as addresser in action 9", "general public acts as addressee in action 6", "item the commission acts as addressee in action 10", "member states acts as addresser in action 1", "member states acts as addresser in action 11", "member states acts as addresser in action 6", "member states competent authorities acts as addresser in action 7", "national authorities acts as addresser in action 4", "project promoter acts as addressee in action 3", "project promoter acts as addresser in action 2", "strategic project promoter acts as addressee in action 4", "strategic project promoter acts as addressee in action 5", "strategic project promoter acts as addressee in action 7", "strategic project promoter acts as addressee in action 9", "strategic project promoter acts as addresser in action 8"].

